From: Sebastian Yerovi <sebasyero94@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 13:26:55 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Tweak hero copy and card styling (no plan changes)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 mock-site/index.html | 4 ++--
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/mock-site/index.html b/mock-site/index.html
index de3db42..d978672 100644
--- a/mock-site/index.html
+++ b/mock-site/index.html
@@ -11,7 +11,7 @@
   h1 { font-size: 32px; margin-bottom: 4px; }
   .hero-copy { color: #555; margin-top: 0; }
   .plans { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; margin: 24px 0; }
-  .plan { background: #fff; border: 1px solid #ddd; border-radius: 8px; padding: 20px; }
+  .plan { background: #fff; border: 1px solid #cfd6e4; border-radius: 12px; padding: 20px; }
   .plan h2 { margin-top: 0; }
   .plan ul { padding-left: 18px; }
   table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; background: #fff; }
@@ -24,7 +24,7 @@
 <div class="banner"><strong>DEMO REPLICA.</strong> This page is a stand-in built for a hackathon demo. It is not Mixpanel's website, and the plan limits are copied from Mixpanel's public pricing page on 2026-10-03 for illustration only. See SOURCES.md.</div>
 <main>
 <h1>Pricing (demo replica)</h1>
-<p class="hero-copy">Explore product analytics for free, then pay as you grow.</p>
+<p class="hero-copy">Start free, then scale your analytics as your team grows.</p>
 
 <section class="plans" id="plans">
   <div class="plan" id="plan-free">
